      "content": "Thanks for the summary. It's a good start, but it feels a little bit too brief for a phone this important to our launch. The word count is a bit low for a 'comprehensive' review, and I'm worried we might be missing some of the nuance in the specific user complaints.\n\nCan you expand on this? I need a much more in-depth, deep dive into these points. Try to go into more detail about every single pro and con mentioned so that the summary is as long and detailed as possible. Again, I don't want *useless* filler, but I need the summary to be much more substantial and descriptive to really capture the 'essence' of the feedback. Make it much more thorough.",
